                            "description": "If true and the node has dependents, it is a blocking reporting checkpoint: every direct dependent must gate on its output via condition, and the node must declare output_schema. Without dependents it is a reporting leaf (a progress wake). Inherits config.node_defaults.report_to_parent",
                            "type": "boolean",
